# Agent judgement behaviour (Round 26 on)

After any official prediction run, check the run against
`docs/agent_judgement/EXPECTED_BEHAVIOUR.md`. That is the intended logic.

The math model is the starting number. This week’s news (what the ratings cannot
see) is used to agree or disagree. Do not treat ladder, SHAP, and standings as
three extra votes. Agree means keep the side; do not climb just for finding an
article. Disagree means come down (or flip only with a concrete research fact).
A specific named loss reason stays at or below 0.65.

When reporting a run, say whether this logic held. Do not treat the final score
as proof the process was right or wrong.
